        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Stench"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(aura, olfactory)\n\n10 feet. A creature entering the aura or starting its turn in the aura must succeed at a DC 18 Fortitude save or become sickened 1 (plus slowed 1 as long as it\u02bcs sickened on a critical failure). While within the aura, the creature takes a \u20132 circumstance penalty to saves against disease and to recover from the sickened condition. A creature that succeeds at its save is temporarily immune for 1 minute."
            },
            "id": "4e62f842-f656-42dd-b7e8-78ecd03de0ff",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:29.866289"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Ghast Fever"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(disease); DC 18 Fortitude; Stage 1: carrier with no ill effect (1 day); Stage 2: 3d8 negative damage and regains half as many Hit Points from all healing (1 day); Stage 3: as stage 2 (1 day); Stage 4: 3d8 negative damage and gains no benefit from healing (1 day); Stage 5: as stage 4 (1 day); Stage 6: dead, and rises as a ghast the next midnight. ()"
            },
            "id": "4ff6e882-1f24-4aa4-ab5e-dafa1330c2d8",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:29.866289"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Paralysis"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(incapacitation, occult, necromancy)\n\nAny living creature hit by Smiler's attack must succeed at a DC 18 Fortitude save or become paralyzed. It can attempt a new save at the end of each of its turns, and the DC cumulatively decreases by 1 on each such save."
            },
